pl_full=⊢ ∀ac perf k prog bs prog' fs' bs'. EVERY (λ(n,m,pp). no_share_inst pp) prog ∧ compile_word_to_stack ac perf k prog bs = (prog',fs',bs') ⇒ EVERY (λ(a,p). no_shmemop p) prog'
